# Web3Forms — contact form backend (free 250 submissions/month).
# 1. Sign up at https://web3forms.com (no account needed, just enter your email)
# 2. Confirm the email sent to contact@devmob.app
# 3. Copy the access key and paste it below
# 4. In Cloudflare Workers → Settings → Variables → add NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY with this value
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=YOUR_ACCESS_KEY_HERE
